# Android / Gradle build output.
#
# These are anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored `build/` also
# matches the vendored three.js directory at
# app/src/main/assets/game/vendor/three/build/, which silently drops the library
# from the APK and leaves the game on a black screen.
/.gradle/
/build/
/app/build/
/app/.cxx/
/captures/
/local.properties

.idea/
*.iml
